  "behavior": {
    "behavior_id": "linkerhand_l20_test_grasp",
    "name": "A test grasp for the L20 hand's twin (labelled: not the lab's)",
    "kind": "program_interpreter",
    "description": "A labelled test program of LinkerBot SDK calls, written by Claude Code because the lab has shared no hand program: set_speed at the SDK's default (100 of 255 for each finger), then finger_move to the GUI's preset 'open' (张开), the preset 'fist' (握拳) and 'open' again, with a sleep after each move. Not tried on the real hand.",
